cookies.body:
Pipeline AI only uses cookies required by the service, without prior consent:

- Supabase session cookies, to keep you signed in;
- the language cookie, kept for one year;
- a cookie that remembers the requested page while you sign in, for one hour at most.

No advertising or audience measurement cookies.

refused.body:
Briefs in these categories are refused, without charging credits:

- medical misinformation: miracle cures, stopping treatment, anti-vaccine claims, denial of a disease;
- sexual or pornographic content;
- extremism: promoting, glorifying or recruiting for an extremist ideology, terrorism or hatred of a group.

Factual, historical or critical treatment of these subjects remains possible. Illegal content, harassment and impersonating a real person are also forbidden. An automatic check runs before every generation.
